      "id": "2072239571706708314",
      "text": "Learning in 2026 means adapting fast.\n\nThe way we learn is changing, so before diving into a new skill it’s worth asking yourself whether you want to learn it the traditional way.\n\nI’ve been exploring AI tools to add motion and animation to my UI designs, and so far, @figma Make has impressed me the most. It’s still in beta, but it has consistently delivered me animations that feel close to what I had in mind and I'm very excited to see how this will develop in the future",
